                  "id": "sk-ov-guide",
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "title": "About This Skill",
                  "markdown": "### About This Skill\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Factory Stage** | Which of the 5 factory stages this skill belongs to |\n| **Version** | Skill version (locked in `skills.lock.json`) |\n| **SHA-256** | First 16 hex chars of content digest |\n| **GitHub URL** | 🔗 Click to open the full **rendered SKILL.md** on GitHub |\n| **Approval Status** | 🟢 APPROVED · 🟡 PENDING · ⬜ DEPRECATED · 🔴 REVOKED |\n\n**To view the full SKILL.md content:** click the **GitHub URL** link in the Details panel above. GitHub renders the markdown with proper formatting.\n\n**Factory stage colors:** 🔵 product-requirements · 🟣 software-architecture · 🟢 software-engineering · 🔴 security-compliance · 🟠 platform-operations"
